            "description": "Returns {cancellations: [...]} for everything open on the account.\n\nNeeds a read_write key.\n\nSign this request before sending it. The signed message is timestamp_ms + METHOD + path, where path includes the query string exactly as sent. See postman/README.md for the one-liner that fills in {{timestamp}} and {{signature}}."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
